title: "@three-ws/notifications-mcp"
abstract: "Read and manage your three.ws notification inbox from any AI agent — list inbound events (pump/market alerts, sales, purchases, social, IRL, account), mark read, tune the per-category delivery matrix, and register Web Push devices. Account-scoped over the live API via a Bearer API key."
